---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面不存在" description="你访问的页面不存在" canonical="/404.html" noindex>
    <div id="main">
        <div class="not-found">
            <div class="not-found-code">404</div>
            <p class="not-found-log">error: route not found</p>
            <h1>这里什么都没有</h1>
            <p>你访问的页面可能已经被移动、重命名，或者从来不存在。</p>
            <div class="not-found-actions">
                <a class="base-link" href="/">
                    <span>返回首页</span>
                </a>
                <a class="base-link" href="/article/categories.html">
                    <span>浏览分类</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
